    <title>降低目标、拥抱生活，会是一种不上进吗？——Vol.5 对话忆菁</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/641bb9408aca9099d711b5b6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">641bb9408aca9099d711b5b6</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 23 Mar 2023 02:28:15 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>从职业教育公司合伙人，到收入不稳定的B站up主；</span><strong><span>从觉得自己不配，到专心去实践自己的愿望。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>把【想做】和【结果】分开，把【自己】和【外界】分开；</span></p><span></span><p><span>虽然活的“很大”，但也要做让自己开心的事；</span></p><span></span><p><span>打破“完美人设”，接受脆弱，看到生活中美好小事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期我们聊到了</span><strong><span>旅居大理的原因、配得感</span></strong><span>、</span><strong><span>抛弃外界标准、放弃结果执念、完美人设、女性需要榜样、年龄和未婚未育</span></strong><span>...</span></p><span></span><p><span>和忆菁聊完，我看到了“向内看”对人的滋养有多大，分享给都经历过不自信的我们。</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>🍃🍃🍃本期内容简介</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>1、旅居大理：北京像是前男友，大理让人快乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>2、</span><strong><span>配得感</span></strong><span>：</span><strong><span>打压式教育造就了自卑，我可能不配有实现愿望的能力</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>3、自我探索：我只是更了解我自己了，不需要“完美人设”</span></p><span></span><p><span>4、女性主义：女性需要榜样，让每个女生都拥有选择的自由</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>🍃🍃🍃本期时间线</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="77">01:17</a> &nbsp;忆菁的简单介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="155">02:35</a> &nbsp;为什么去旅居大理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="285">04:45</a> &nbsp;我一直没有变，我只是更了解我自己了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="621">10:21</a> &nbsp;打压式教育让我不自信</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="947">15:47</a> &nbsp;</span><strong><span>我可能不配有实现愿望的能力，但这是不对的⭐️</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1155">19:15</a> &nbsp;现在全身心的接纳了自己吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1250">20:50</a> &nbsp;为什么做了女性沟通训练营</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1425">23:45</a> &nbsp;女性在沟通上面和男性有差异吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1826">30:26</a> &nbsp;</span><strong><span>配得感很低怎么办？⭐️</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2465">41:05</a> &nbsp;</span><strong><span>降低目标、拥抱生活，会是一种不上进吗？⭐️</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2783">46:23</a> &nbsp;怎么活出了自己的风格</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3008">50:08</a> &nbsp;</span><strong><span>曾经用稳定掩盖内心的混乱感⭐️</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3129">52:09</a> &nbsp;不需要“完美人设”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3236">53:56</a> &nbsp;会怎么理解现在的自己？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3410">56:50</a> &nbsp;忆菁变得可爱了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3567">59:27</a> &nbsp;</span><strong><span>从迷失到清醒，我学会了抛弃外界标准⭐️</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4088">68:08</a> &nbsp;会有时间的紧迫感吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4145">69:05</a> &nbsp;</span><strong><span>未婚未育的状态下选择了自由职业，会有压力吗？⭐️</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4349">72:29</a> &nbsp;你对女性主义有什么看法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4580">76:20</a> &nbsp;希望忆菁在大理开心，end</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>🍃🍃🍃本期主播</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><strong><span>雅如</span></strong><span>：INTP，大厂打工边缘人，不靠谱的创业者（曾服务于近10w大学生，帮助他们找到职业方向）。25岁走遍了全国，32岁前忙碌于“做个好产品”。现在只想喝茶、🌞晒太阳、聊天。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>忆菁</span></strong><span>：前职业教育公司合伙人、上市公司运营总监。现旅居大理，自由职业者、B站UP主（忆菁很无敌），兼职美食创造者和养生菜鸟。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu8uwgbrzS8hyNfCJv5x7vkh5-yN.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>我真的太喜欢忆菁的独特风格了，偷偷放张pyq照片，哈哈哈~</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltIwpzeuotfFolWDpbC-hEm0r1S-.m4a" length="74171163" type="audio/mp4"/>
